e cookies but disabling some of them may affect your browsing experience.<\\/p>\",\"showMore\":\"Show more\",\"showLess\":\"Show less\",\"category\":{\"elements\":{\"alwaysEnabled\":\"Always Active\",\"enable\":\"Enable\",\"disable\":\"Disable\"}},\"buttons\":{\"elements\":{\"accept\":\"Accept All\",\"save\":\"Save My Preferences\",\"reject\":\"Reject All\"}},\"closeButton\":\"Close\"}},\"optoutPopup\":{\"elements\":{\"title\":\"Prefer\\u00eancias de exclus\\u00e3o\",\"description\":\"<p>Utilizamos cookies de terceiros que nos ajudam a analisar como voc\\u00ea usa este site, armazenam suas prefer\\u00eancias e fornecem conte\\u00fado e an\\u00fancios que s\\u00e3o relevantes para voc\\u00ea. No entanto, voc\\u00ea pode desativar esses cookies marcando \\u201cN\\u00e3o vender ou compartilhar minhas informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es pessoais\\u201d e clicando no bot\\u00e3o \\u201cSalvar minhas prefer\\u00eancias\\u201d. Depois de cancelar,<br \\/>voc\\u00ea pode optar novamente a qualquer momento desmarcando \\\"N\\u00e3o vender ou compartilhar minhas informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es pessoais\\\" e clicando no bot\\u00e3o \\\"Salvar minhas prefer\\u00eancias\\\".<\\/p>\",\"optOption\":{\"elements\":{\"title\":\"N\\u00e3o venda ou compartilhe minhas informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es pessoais\",\"enable\":\"Enable\",\"disable\":\"Disable\"}},\"gpcOption\":{\"elements\":{\"description\":\"<p>Your opt-out settings for this website have been respected since we detected a <b>Global Privacy Control<\\/b> signal from your browser and, therefore, you cannot change this setting.<\\/p>\"}},\"showLess\":\"Mostrar Menos\",\"showMore\":\"Mostrar Mais\",\"buttons\":{\"elements\":{\"cancel\":\"Cancelar\",\"confirm\":\"Salvar minhas prefer\\u00eancias\"}},\"closeButton\":\"Close\"}},\"revisitConsent\":{\"elements\":{\"title\":\"Prefer\\u00eancias de consentimento\"}},\"auditTable\":{\"elements\":{\"headers\":{\"elements\":{\"id\":\"Cookie\",\"duration\":\"Dura\\u00e7\\u00e3o\",\"description\":\"Descri\\u00e7\\u00e3o\"}},\"message\":\"No cookies to display.\"}},\"videoPlaceholder\":{\"elements\":{\"title\":\"Por favor aceite cookies para acessar este conte\\u00fado\"}}}}', '2026-03-22 22:46:36', '2026-03-22 22:46:36');
